 because it ignores the three-lamp trial.\n</think>\n\n{\"answer\":\"C\",\"confidence\":90,\"reason\":\"Both two-lamp and three-lamp PASS trials are consistent with AtLeast-rule but only two-lamp aligns with Exactly-rule, but three-lamp remains active.\"}",
